  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "れいきの　まざった　いとを　はく。\nいとで　からだを　えだに　まきつけ\nつららの　ふりをして　ねむるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "냉기가 서린 실을 뿜는다.\n실로 몸을 가지에 휘감아서\n고드름인 척하고 잠든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能吐出帶著冷氣的絲。\n會用絲把自己掛在樹枝上，\n一邊裝成冰柱一邊睡覺。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il crache un fil gelé qu’il utilise pour s’accrocher\nà une branche : il dort ainsi en imitant\nune stalactite.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es spinnt einen eiskalten Faden, mit dem es sich\nan einen Ast hängt. Dabei tut es so, als wäre es\nein Eiszapfen, um in Ruhe schlafen zu können.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Teje un hilo gélido que le permite aferrarse a\nlas ramas y simula ser un carámbano mientras\nduerme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si assicura a un ramo con il filo gelido che\nproduce dalla bocca e dorme fingendosi\nun ghiacciolo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It spits out thread imbued with a frigid sort of\nenergy and uses it to tie its body to branches,\ndisguising itself as an icicle while it sleeps.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "冷気の　混ざった　糸を　吐く。\n糸で　体を　枝に　巻きつけ\n氷柱の　振りをして　眠るのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "能吐出带着冷气的丝。\n会用丝把自己挂在树枝上\n一边装成冰柱一边睡觉。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Teje un hilo gélido que le permite aferrarse a\nlas ramas y simula ser un carámbano mientras\nduerme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "じめんに　つもった　ゆきを　たべる。\nたくさん　たべれば　たべるほど\nせなかの　トゲは　りっぱに　そだつ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "땅에 쌓인 눈을 먹는다.\n많이 먹으면 먹을수록\n등의 가시는 훌륭하게 자란다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會吃地面上的積雪。\n吃得越多，背上的\n刺就會長得越挺拔。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se nourrit de la neige entassée sur le sol.\nPlus il en mange, plus les épines sur son dos\ngrandissent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es frisst den Schnee, der sich am Boden\nangesammelt hat. Je mehr es frisst, desto größer\nwerden die Stacheln auf seinem Rücken.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se nutre de la nieve acumulada en el terreno.\nCuanta más ingiere, más imponentes se vuelven\nlas púas que presenta en el lomo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si nutre della neve accumulatasi sul terreno.\nPiù ne mangia, più gli aculei sul suo dorso\ndiventano grandi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It eats snow that piles up on the ground.\nThe more snow it eats, the bigger and more\nimpressive the spikes on its back grow.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "地面に　積もった　雪を　食べる。\nたくさん　食べれば　食べるほど\n背中の　棘は　立派に　育つ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会吃地面上的积雪。\n吃得越多，背上的\n刺就会长得越挺拔。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se nutre de la nieve acumulada en el terreno.\nCuanta más ingiere, más imponentes se vuelven\nlas púas que presenta en el lomo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "エサは　じめんに　つもった　ゆき。やわらかな　しんせつを　このみさんちょう　めざして　たべすすむ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "땅에 쌓인 눈이 먹이다. 새로 내린 부드러운 눈을 좋아해서 산꼭대기를 향해 먹으며 움직인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "地面的積雪是牠的主食。對新下的鬆軟白雪情有獨鍾，會朝著山頂一路吃過去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se nourrit de la neige qui s’accumule au sol. Il la préfère fraîche et va jusqu’au sommet des montagnes en mangeant la neige sur son chemin.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ernährt sich von am Boden angesammeltem Schnee. Da es weichen Neuschnee bevorzugt, frisst es sich bergauf bis zum Gipfel vor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se alimenta de la nieve acumulada en el terreno. Como adora la suave nieve virgen, irá comiendo montaña arriba hasta llegar a la cima.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si nutre della neve accumulata sul terreno. Predilige quella fresca e soffice, che mangia man mano che avanza verso la cima dei monti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It eats snow that has accumulated on the ground. It prefers soft, freshly fallen snow, so it will eat its way up a mountain, aiming for the peak.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "エサは　地面に　積もった　雪。柔らかな　新雪を　好み山頂　目指して　食べ進む。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "地面的积雪是它的食物。尤其喜爱刚下的松软白雪，会朝着山顶一路吃过去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se alimenta de la nieve acumulada en el terreno. Como adora la suave nieve virgen, irá comiendo montaña arriba hasta llegar a la cima.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たべた　ゆきから　えた　れいきをたいないの　きかんで　ぞうふくしてつららのような　トゲを　つくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "먹은 눈을 통해 얻은 냉기를 체내 기관에서 증폭시켜서 고드름 같은 가시를 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會吃掉雪來獲得寒氣，並利用體內的器官使其變得更加冰冷，好讓牠能做出如冰柱般的尖刺。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il amplifie l’air froid qu’il absorbe en mangeant de la neige, ce qui lui permet de créer ses pointes semblables à des pics de glace.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit den inneren Organen verstärkt es die Kälte, die es mit dem Schnee aufnimmt. Dadurch kann es Stacheln formen, die wie Eiszapfen aussehen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Amplifica en sus órganos internos el frío que consigue al comer nieve y lo usa para crear sus púas como carámbanos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mangiando neve immagazzina aria gelida, poi ne amplifica l’effetto tramite gli organi interni per creare gli aculei di ghiaccio che ha sul dorso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Within its internal organs, Snom amplifies the frigid air it gets from eating snow and then uses this amplified air to create icicle-like spikes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "食べた　雪から　得た　冷気を体内の　器官で　増幅して氷柱のような　トゲを　作る。",
